; Interprets: Private ACME-HSS
;; What the ACME-HSS document's prose says, in its clause order.


;; Read from the clause's first paragraph.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: id-length
; AVP: ACME-Id
; Within: ACME-Data
; Section: 7.3.5
; Versions: *..1.2.0
"The ACME-Id shall be 1 to 15 characters long."
    length 1..15 characters ;; the characters, not the octets


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: flags-request
; AVP: ACME-Flags
; Command: ACME-Request
; Application-ID: 16777999
; Section: 7.3.6
; Table: 7.3.6/1
; Versions: 1.0.0..1.2.0 ;; widened by --expand-ranges
"It shall be present only if the Withdraw Data bit is set."
    present-if ACME-Flags bit "Withdraw Data"
